    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index climbed by a further 533 points week-on -week to 17,221, a level last reached in November 2009. There were increases of $5,000/day and $7,000/day in the round-voyage and fronthaul rates to $55,000/day and $82,000/day, respectively.",
